{
  "name": "F6 Testimonial Request",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "74b6b966-5c1c-5815-9275-88953b320a97",
      "name": "Read me first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "F6 Testimonial Request\n\nWhat it does: every morning it reads your sales sheet. If a buyer bought 10 or more days ago and has not been asked yet, it sends a short friendly request and marks them as asked.\n\nConnect: Google Sheets (the same sheet F3 writes to; columns email, buyDate, testimonialAsked) and Gmail. Test with a fake row dated 10 days ago and your own email. Never invent or edit testimonials: use only what real buyers write.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 620
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "271422cb-9ab1-5a89-90cf-4fd5d8430e0c",
      "name": "Every morning at 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ba1a23b2-5b00-50bd-a639-665d93d37597",
      "name": "Read the sales sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "{{YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID}}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "{{YOUR_SHEET_TAB_NAME}}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dcfe6dff-87fa-5953-b72f-f54ecc047ca3",
      "name": "Bought 10+ days ago and not asked?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "dbe7e2c0-6f88-55ed-8d46-f86152d597d7",
              "leftValue": "={{ $now.diff(DateTime.fromISO($json.buyDate), 'days').days >= 10 && !$json.testimonialAsked }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f08b184a-c667-56a2-8402-bd335bbfb6c5",
      "name": "Ask for feedback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        720,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "Quick question about your purchase",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "Hi,\n\nYou have had the product for a little while. Could you reply with two lines: what helped, and what you would change? I read every answer. If you are happy for me to quote you, say so and tell me how you would like your name shown.\n\nYOUR_NAME\n{{YOUR_BUSINESS_NAME}}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dcd63505-dabc-57a9-ba91-047047015bec",
      "name": "Mark as asked",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        960,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "{{YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID}}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "{{YOUR_SHEET_TAB_NAME}}"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "testimonialAsked": "={{ $now.toISODate() }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "email"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every morning at 8": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read the sales sheet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read the sales sheet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Bought 10+ days ago and not asked?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Bought 10+ days ago and not asked?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ask for feedback",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ask for feedback": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Mark as asked",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "active": false,
  "tags": []
}